06:02.760 --> 06:04.950
Why don't we go out and get smashed?

06:04.950 --> 06:07.450
Wait, you're only 18! Can't drink yet!

06:07.450 --> 06:08.240
Drink...

06:10.180 --> 06:11.240
Sorry.

06:12.630 --> 06:14.730
It's nothing. Don't worry about me.

06:15.560 --> 06:18.450
I'd just like to be 
left alone for a while.

06:29.620 --> 06:30.910
Aqu-tan! Aqu-tan! Aqu-tan!

06:31.230 --> 06:33.160
Whoa, why so frantic?

06:33.160 --> 06:36.620
<b>MEMcho, I bet your scalp smells good as hell.
I'll pay 100,000 yen for your dandruff. Deal?</b>

06:33.610 --> 06:37.040
Did you get a creepy message 
in your Marshmallow Q&As?

06:36.620 --> 06:36.750
<b>MEMcho, I bet your scalp smells good as hell.
I'll pay 100,000 yen for your dandruff. Deal?</b>

06:37.040 --> 06:38.710
Swing and a miss!

06:38.710 --> 06:41.840
That happens all the time! 
Why would I pitch a fit over it now?!

06:42.360 --> 06:45.550
We need to do something! 
Kana-chan might leave B-Komachi!

06:47.550 --> 06:49.360
What makes you think so?

06:52.190 --> 06:58.110
You know how she always runs her mouth 
but never lets her actual feelings show?

06:58.740 --> 07:04.590
She's always talking smack to cover up 
what she's thinking on the inside.

07:05.810 --> 07:10.350
But lately, she's been making it 
obvious that she's in a funk.

07:11.280 --> 07:14.390
It seems like a pretty clear yellow flag.

07:15.180 --> 07:18.960
If this keeps up, 
things might really turn sour.

07:21.420 --> 07:23.580
Look after her somehow.

07:23.580 --> 07:26.080
I'm doing everything I can, okay?

07:26.690 --> 07:27.470
But...

07:28.010 --> 07:31.760
I bet nothing I say 
will get through to her.

07:34.020 --> 07:36.550
And you know how Ruby is now.

07:38.250 --> 07:40.360
The only one who can 
really fix Kana-chan is...

07:40.360 --> 07:42.540
Don't come to me for help with Arima.

07:43.660 --> 07:47.320
Like I told you before, 
I'm not going to half-ass this.

07:47.890 --> 07:49.490
I won't be irresponsible.

07:51.140 --> 07:53.320
I have no right to.

07:54.020 --> 07:56.150
I get what you're saying.

07:56.630 --> 07:58.750
You don't want to lead her on...

07:59.710 --> 08:03.590
You don't wanna hurt her any more, right?

08:05.140 --> 08:09.730
But hey, listen... Kana-chan...

08:11.070 --> 08:15.030
Kana-chan's probably only being 
an idol for you, Aqu-tan.

08:16.490 --> 08:19.960
She believed in and took this path 
because you asked her to.

08:20.900 --> 08:23.930
She became an idol 
because that's what you wanted.

08:25.110 --> 08:28.930
You're the one who 
dragged her into this world.

08:32.800 --> 08:34.760
It doesn't have to be a lot.

08:35.400 --> 08:37.200
Just give her something, anything.

09:23.940 --> 09:25.670
Excuse me.

09:26.000 --> 09:28.680
You're Kana Arima-san, yes?

