<i>A tabloid reporter? Why?</i>

10:14.780 --> 10:17.280
<i>Is this about that night?</i>

10:17.900 --> 10:22.560
The two of you went into 
his apartment the other night, yes?

10:22.860 --> 10:26.770
His staff had all left by that time.

10:24.520 --> 10:25.980
<i>What do I do?</i>

10:27.250 --> 10:30.730
He's a married man, and yet 
you spent all night together.

10:28.400 --> 10:29.840
<i>What do I say?</i>

10:31.100 --> 10:32.740
What were you two doing?

10:31.800 --> 10:33.340
<i>What do I say?</i>

10:33.190 --> 10:34.700
Arima-san.

10:34.980 --> 10:37.530
This <i>is</i> you, is it not?

10:37.190 --> 10:38.440
<i>What </i>can<i> I say?</i>

10:37.530 --> 10:40.720
You two seem quite close.

10:42.120 --> 10:43.620
Why are you silent?

10:43.620 --> 10:44.450
Could you—

10:46.620 --> 10:48.960
Huh? Wait, Arima-san?

10:50.420 --> 10:53.530
Does running away mean you admit it?

10:55.900 --> 10:58.640
Why won't you explain yourself?

10:59.070 --> 11:00.260
Arima-san!

11:14.490 --> 11:17.240
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

11:14.490 --> 11:17.240
<b>< Mako Azami</b>

11:14.490 --> 11:17.240
<b>Are you free rn?!</b>

11:14.490 --> 11:17.240
<b>I'm having dinner
in Roppongi</b>

11:14.490 --> 11:17.240
<b>Director Shima's
gonna join me</b>

11:14.490 --> 11:17.240
<b>Wanna come??</b>

11:17.240 --> 11:19.490
There you are, Shima!

11:19.820 --> 11:22.740
If he takes a liking to you, 
you could land an acting gig.

11:23.720 --> 11:24.830
Go for it.

11:25.270 --> 11:28.280
He's not a playboy or anything.

11:43.750 --> 11:45.450
<i>Is this going to be in the news?</i>

11:45.850 --> 11:48.020
<i>I didn't do anything!</i>

