12:04.210 --> 12:08.940
<i>This is gonna hurt the other B-Komachi 
members and the agency staff, too.</i>

12:12.110 --> 12:13.610
<i>What do I do?</i>

12:15.530 --> 12:17.100
<i>What do I do?</i>

12:37.740 --> 12:40.700
So I looked up 
"how to keep white ants as pets"...

12:38.430 --> 12:40.700
Huh? You can't get in touch with her?

12:40.700 --> 12:44.360
<i>No. And we have no idea where she's gone.</i>

12:44.360 --> 12:46.700
<i>Did Ruby get anything?</i>

12:46.700 --> 12:48.750
<i>A message? A call?</i>

12:48.750 --> 12:52.430
Sorry, Ruby-san's shoot is running 
behind schedule right now.

12:52.430 --> 12:54.130
I'll ask her once she's done.

12:54.380 --> 12:57.170
Okay, please do.

13:04.590 --> 13:07.650
Nope, Kana-chan's not answering.

13:12.110 --> 13:14.480
She wasn't in the studio, either.

13:16.790 --> 13:21.150
She's never once skipped lessons before.

13:21.850 --> 13:22.960
I...

13:23.650 --> 13:25.280
I'm gonna go look for her!

13:25.280 --> 13:26.120
Hold it.

13:26.510 --> 13:30.850
Do you have any leads? 
Just running around isn't going to help.

13:32.130 --> 13:33.460
I know that...

13:33.890 --> 13:36.250
But I can't just sit around and wait!

13:41.630 --> 13:45.330
It could be that Arima-san's 
already heard the news.

13:46.080 --> 13:47.520
I swear...

13:48.450 --> 13:53.760
We need to hear the details from her 
to figure out how to counter this, too.

13:56.060 --> 13:58.530
But she may not come back today.

13:59.890 --> 14:00.980
She will.

14:01.590 --> 14:03.610
You don't get it.

14:03.610 --> 14:06.540
I know you're an exception,

14:06.540 --> 14:11.500
but kids around her age 
normally aren't that tough.

14:12.620 --> 14:15.580
Publishers, fans, and us agencies...

14:15.970 --> 14:19.050
We prey on young, fragile kids

14:19.050 --> 14:21.050
<b>You're an idol.
Please act more responsibly.</b>

14:19.300 --> 14:23.010
<b>you're so unserious</b>

14:19.460 --> 14:22.480
and put too much pressure 
and responsibility on their shoulders.

14:21.760 --> 14:23.010
<b>please think about
how your fans might feel</b>

14:23.350 --> 14:28.910
This business thrives on breaking 
the hearts and lives of you kids.

14:33.730 --> 14:35.160
I'm heading out, too.

14:36.960 --> 14:39.950
I have to bring MEM back, at least.

14:57.790 --> 15:00.250
<i>An idol, falling for a guy?</i>

15:00.250 --> 15:02.210
<i>Talk about unprofessional.</i>

15:07.080 --> 15:09.720
<i>Hurting your peers doesn't bother you?</i>

15:11.440 --> 15:13.270
That was so cute, right?

15:13.270 --> 15:14.410
Yeah!

15:13.600 --> 15:15.770
<i>Way to ruin your image.</i>

15:15.770 --> 15:18.680
<i>You're just so... filthy.</i>

15:18.680 --> 15:20.150
<i>I trusted you.</i>

15:20.150 --> 15:23.280
<i>Gimme back all the money I spent on you.</i>

15:27.910 --> 15:32.170
<i>I've seen what happens to disgraced idols 
too many times to count.</i>

15:32.840 --> 15:33.920
<i>You let me down.</i>

15:33.290 --> 15:36.870
<i>I know exactly what fans say to them.</i>

15:33.920 --> 15:37.320
<i>If you cared about your fans at all, 
you never would've done this.</i>

15:37.320 --> 15:38.720
<i>I tore up your trading cards.</i>

15:38.020 --> 15:39.440
<i>I'm done being an otaku.</i>

15:39.440 --> 15:41.710
<i>Disgusting. I can't.</i>

15:42.070 --> 15:44.100
<i>Scamming little whore.</i>

15:44.100 --> 15:45.730
<i>Just quit already. Get out of my sight.</i>

15:45.730 --> 15:48.610
<i>Some guy's probably 
consoling her right now.</i>

15:47.510 --> 15:50.980
<i>If you're gonna be a pro idol, 
be a pro all the way.</i>

15:49.470 --> 15:51.740
<i>I trusted her, and she betrayed me.</i>

15:50.980 --> 15:53.780
<i>Nobody would care if she'd 
done this after she retired.</i>

15:51.920 --> 15:55.760
<i>"I spent the money you spent on
me on dates with a guy, lol!"</i>

15:53.780 --> 15:57.180
<i>She didn't even stop to think 
this would hurt her group.</i>

15:54.820 --> 15:58.040
<i>I only stanned her 'cuz I
thought she'd never do this.</i>

15:56.000 --> 15:58.040
<i>The girl lost to horny.</i>

15:57.190 --> 16:01.690
<i>Don't be an idol 
if you want a love life.</i>

15:57.600 --> 16:00.380
<i>Lack of character,
plain and simple.</i>

15:58.240 --> 16:01.020
<i>You do this after acting 
all high and mighty?</i>

15:58.970 --> 16:01.690
<i>Can't even stick to
her own word, huh?</i>

16:03.880 --> 16:09.280
<i>In the end, you only saw being an idol 
as a way to stay in the industry.</i>

16:23.290 --> 16:25.130
read

16:23.290 --> 16:25.130
Where'd you go?

16:25.130 --> 16:27.250
read

16:25.130 --> 16:27.250
Where'd you go?

16:25.130 --> 16:27.260
Come back already

16:27.260 --> 16:29.510
Sheesh, that MEM...

