16:52.030 --> 16:56.810
Being chosen for that role 
doesn't feel so bad, I guess!

17:17.000 --> 17:21.350
<i>If I quit, will they let me off the hook?</i>

17:22.240 --> 17:26.280
<i>I guess I never was meant to be an idol.</i>

17:27.480 --> 17:30.590
<i>I have a foul mouth 
and a nasty personality,</i>

17:30.590 --> 17:34.850
<i>and I'm always whining about 
not getting the gigs I really want.</i>

17:35.670 --> 17:39.370
<i>I'm nothing like the ideal 
idol in everyone's minds.</i>

17:40.540 --> 17:45.820
<i>I'm not genuine enough to believe 
I'm "doing it for the fans."</i>

17:47.050 --> 17:51.050
<i>I'm the furthest thing 
from sweet and innocent.</i>

17:52.320 --> 17:55.540
<i>I tried to hang in there somehow, 
and look where it got me.</i>

17:56.560 --> 18:00.240
<i>I don't know what I'm 
supposed to do anymore.</i>

18:01.570 --> 18:03.390
<i>Somebody tell me.</i>

18:05.330 --> 18:09.400
<i>Nobody wants the real Kana Arima.</i>

18:16.280 --> 18:17.740
<i>I'm not cut out for this.</i>

18:35.430 --> 18:37.030
I'm not meant for this!

18:45.650 --> 18:46.940
Help me...

18:48.350 --> 18:51.000
Help me, Aqua.

19:09.360 --> 19:11.700
What the hell did I just say?

19:12.320 --> 19:16.220
I turn to a guy for help 
only when <i>I</i> need it?

19:17.690 --> 19:20.570
How gross can I be?

19:21.540 --> 19:25.310
Am I trying to make myself feel better 
by playing the damsel in distress?

19:26.020 --> 19:29.940
Am I begging and pleading 
for forgiveness and approval?

19:35.160 --> 19:36.680
Shame on me.

19:37.740 --> 19:42.960
Oh, man. They're gonna say I'm a slut 
who's sleeping her way up.

19:52.500 --> 19:54.580
Talk all the shit you want, you losers!

19:54.580 --> 19:58.510
I've been dealing with that crap 
since I was a preschooler!

19:58.810 --> 20:06.100
I don't even like the fans! 
What do I care what they say about me?

20:06.620 --> 20:10.350
Somebody else can play 
the sweet and innocent role.

20:10.690 --> 20:13.850
No matter what, no matter how...

20:13.850 --> 20:16.730
I'm gonna be myself!

20:16.730 --> 20:20.820
And I'm gonna survive in showbiz 
as just little ol' me!

20:24.270 --> 20:25.250
<i>See?</i>

20:25.570 --> 20:29.080
<i>It'll take way more than this 
to break Kana Arima.</i>

20:29.710 --> 20:31.410
I'm heading out to look for her too
Let me know if you find anything

20:29.710 --> 20:31.410
Thanks, Aqu-tan.

20:29.710 --> 20:31.410
I'll hit up places she's likely to go

20:29.710 --> 20:31.410
Where'd you go?

20:29.710 --> 20:31.410
Come back already

20:30.350 --> 20:32.800
<i>Arima will be fine.</i>

20:32.670 --> 20:34.170
Look around here

20:38.130 --> 20:41.560
<i>She has B-Komachi and the rest.</i>

20:44.430 --> 20:45.560
<i>Me?</i>

20:46.660 --> 20:48.060
<i>She doesn't need me.</i>

21:10.920 --> 21:18.880
<b>Hikaru Kamiki

Started an agency at 25

Was in Lalalai for six years,
from the age of 10 to 16

No details on later activity

Might have an accomplice?</b>

21:10.920 --> 21:18.880
<b>Aqua Hoshino

Been in showbiz since childhood

Thinks the target of his revenge is dead

Must not be allowed to come in contact</b>

21:13.290 --> 21:14.800
<i>Hikaru Kamiki.</i>

21:15.230 --> 21:18.000
<i>He started his own agency when he was 25.</i>

21:19.760 --> 21:24.600
<i>Getting information on someone is easy 
once you know who you're investigating.</i>

21:24.890 --> 21:31.340
<i>I couldn't figure out what he did from 
16, when he quit Lalalai, until 25...</i>

21:34.270 --> 21:37.230
<b>Media EYES, Inc.</b>

21:35.530 --> 21:36.710
<i>But that's the place.</i>

21:43.260 --> 21:46.910
Maybe I should have become 
a private eye, not an actress.

